# VCS — Bitbucket

Required env: `BB_AUTH_STRING` (`x-token-auth:<app-password>` with `pullrequest:write` + `repository:write` scopes), or workspace OAuth via the Atlassian MCP server when reachable.

## Operations

<!-- Harness scaffold: integration=bitbucket (vcs) -->

- Open PR via REST → `curl -X POST -u "${BB_AUTH_STRING/:/:}" "https://api.bitbucket.org/2.0/repositories/${BB_WORKSPACE}/${BB_REPO}/pullrequests" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d @body.json`
  - `body.json`: `{ "title": "...", "source": {"branch": {"name": "<head>"}}, "destination": {"branch": {"name": "main"}}, "description": "..." }`
- Fetch PR → `curl -u "${BB_AUTH_STRING/:/:}" "https://api.bitbucket.org/2.0/repositories/${BB_WORKSPACE}/${BB_REPO}/pullrequests/<num>"`
- Diff → `curl -u "${BB_AUTH_STRING/:/:}" "https://api.bitbucket.org/2.0/repositories/${BB_WORKSPACE}/${BB_REPO}/pullrequests/<num>/diff"`
- Pipeline status → `curl -u "${BB_AUTH_STRING/:/:}" "https://api.bitbucket.org/2.0/repositories/${BB_WORKSPACE}/${BB_REPO}/pipelines/?sort=-created_on&pagelen=5"`
- Release (tag-driven via Bitbucket Pipelines) → `git tag v<X> && git push origin v<X>` (pipeline auto-builds + publishes per `bitbucket-pipelines.yml`)

