## CI integration
- Pipeline file: `bitbucket-pipelines.yml` at repo root
- Triggers: `pull-requests:` (per branch) + `branches.main:` (post-merge)
- Auto-release via `python-semantic-release`: see [documents/releases.md](documents/releases.md)
- Repository variables required: `BB_AUTH_STRING` (mandatory for release-step push-back); `PYPI_TOKEN` (optional gate for `twine upload`)
